cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use csl-atlas, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "csl-atlas: an evidence-graded atlas of the Cologne Digital Sanskrit Lexicon"
abstract: >-
  An interactive companion to the Cologne Digital Sanskrit Lexicon (CDSL):
  comparative microstructural analysis of nine narrative Sanskrit-dictionary
  chapters plus an all-dictionary coverage layer for every local CDSL v02
  source dictionary. Every public claim carries an explicit evidence label
  (observed / derived / inferred / reviewed) and every dataset is reproducible
  from committed JSON plus the csl-orig source dictionaries.
type: software
